      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَامَ</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضُومُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَوْمٌ</span>, a dial. var. of
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَامَ</span>, aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَضِيمُ</span>, inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضَيْمٌ</span>: (K:) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضُمْتُهُ</span>, like
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ضِمْتُهُ</span>, signifying <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ظَلَمْتُهُ</span> [<i>I wronged him,</i> &amp;c.].
(M, TA.)

